<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Amphetamines (use me)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">VIOLENT VIRA</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Till' Death Was Never Enough</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5cB8tmCkOzktCpgzYAZEKi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Amy Janeth Gonzalez"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Amy Janeth Gonzalez"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Could never understand why we're a tragedy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I swallowed all my pride took the amphetamines</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're one the same, you use them like you do with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Bite into my flesh and tear the skin and tendons</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Devour me like you always do</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You always knew the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We can't say adieu</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(If no one else can hurt me like you do)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hurt me, use me like you do</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sever my head and take all the parts that you need from me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Complacent and silent tell me what a bride to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Bite into my flesh and tear the skin and tendons</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Devour me like you always do</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You always knew the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We can't say adieu</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(If no one else can hurt me like you do)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Use me, use me like you do</p></div></body></tt>